        "description": "Identifies processes started from binaries whose SHA-256 hash matches a Mossy Teapot banking trojan sample, as reported in campaign PTF-01761. The indicators are synthetic and use reserved address and domain ranges, so they match no real traffic.",
        "false_positives": [
            "Security testing that replays known indicators.",
            "A shared hosting address or domain that later served benign content."
        ],
        "from": "now-9m",
        "index": [
            "logs-endpoint.events.process-*"
        ],
        "language": "eql",
        "license": "Elastic License v2",
        "name": "Mossy Teapot Banking Trojan: Process started from known malicious binary (PTF-01761)",
        "note": "## Triage and analysis\n\n### Investigating Mossy Teapot Banking Trojan: Process started from known malicious binary\n\nThis rule matches indicators that the Partner Threat Feed attributes to the Mossy Teapot banking trojan in campaign PTF-01761.\n\n### Possible investigation steps\n\n- Review the matching event and the host or user it came from.\n- Look for other indicators from the same campaign on the same host.\n- Check the process tree around the event for the initial execution or delivery.\n\n### Response and remediation\n\n- Isolate the host if the match is confirmed.\n- Block the indicators at the network edge and on endpoints.\n- Reset credentials used on the host.\n",
        "query": "process where event.type == \"start\" and process.hash.sha256 in (\"1632abadd52651b45496bc57d4b57672ca1d82d3128e8798148ca4b50990e77b\", \"014944294442c828641371b96f9fa59b8b73e76c29e593368d5fc2028aa5df58\", \"123f4868e909616a2622910ce603c174be214fa9050492d27dcc0ac8df9a938d\", \"b79bbfe7b52ac5d97cd2a4f3a2db48c1dcfa39e31d734aff12bacfad950497ce\", \"e59a0fcb0de865d4de2afac904ccb19fcbecc49131e8c95559f92fda4733af37\", \"0a8dc1f8a94f0bbf0921c35d0b8a5fe55a9f8711546b060a8e44288dd606a29b\", \"cf26601edc0726ba2e0484dbe14732d5ae2566e6672cbe8b7fa29b04d30f7692\", \"ef1e26142c0eefefe186532287d62649a80d5d77749d337e5187c176c00ee088\", \"2890bcfbfb5eac59984ee49512dd051a6bc54bf0bad04e85a7d97d8cd0892186\", \"230cd371d0b23a01a956cd4156561b200159d1accdd424e277ac6a44e1125248\")",
